-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上的结构，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6c712d26a957f90f\" href=\"?note=6c712d26a957f90f\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-rank\">57-df-quantifier-rank</a>。不带赋值的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a> 对全部赋值取真值，仍比较全部开公式，不改成只比较句子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}n\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathfrak{A} \\equiv_n \\mathfrak{B} \\Leftrightarrow \\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi) \\leq n \\Rightarrow (\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi \\Leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{B} \\models \\varphi))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}n\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathfrak{A} \\equiv_n \\mathfrak{B} \\Leftrightarrow \\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi) \\leq n \\Rightarrow (\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi \\Leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{B} \\models \\varphi))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetA